<title>UK: CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SECOND ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SECOND ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised draw for the second round</p>
<p>of the NatWest Trophy after Tuesday's matches:</p>
<p> At Chelmsford  - Essex v Worcestershire</p>
<p> At Southampton - Hampshire v Glamorgan</p>
<p> At Leicester   - Leicestershire v Yorkshire</p>
<p> At Derby	 - Derbyshire v Northamptonshire</p>
<p> At Uxbridge    - Middlesex v Gloucestershire</p>
<p> At The Oval    - Surrey v Nottinghamshire</p>
<p> At Hove	  - Sussex v Lancashire</p>
<p> At Edgbaston   - Warwickshire v Somerset</p>
<p>Matches to be played Wednesday, July 9.</p>
</text>
